.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH repo 1  "repo " 
.SH NAME
repo \- Repository operations
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBrepo\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Repository operations
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
repo\-create(1)
Create a new repository on the platform
.TP
repo\-clone(1)
Clone a repository to the local filesystem
.TP
repo\-list(1)
List repositories accessible to the authenticated principal
.TP
repo\-view(1)
Show details of a single repository
.TP
repo\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
